  <section>
    <h2>What percentage of the Stars do you actually keep?</h2>
    <p>You keep <strong>85%</strong> of the Stars paid for a message; Telegram keeps the remaining <strong>15%</strong> as commission. That's a different split from admin-to-audience monetization like a channel subscription or paid post, where the channel keeps 100% — Star Messages operates at the personal level and doubles as a spam filter.</p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Can you refund a message after reading it?</h2>
    <p>Yes. Even after a message has arrived and you've read it, you can instantly refund the Stars to the sender with a single tap — handy if it turns out to be spam, or you simply don't want to continue the conversation.</p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>What do you see about an unknown sender?</h2>
    <p>Alongside Star Messages, Telegram shows extra information about an unfamiliar sender — useful for spotting scams too:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>The sender's <strong>country</strong> (based on their phone number);</li>
      <li>Whether you share any <strong>mutual groups</strong>;</li>
      <li>Their Telegram <strong>registration date</strong>;</li>
      <li>When their <strong>profile photo or username last changed</strong>;</li>
      <li>Their <strong>verification status</strong>.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>Full safety guide: <a href="/en/blog/is-buying-telegram-stars-safe">is buying Telegram Stars safe?</a></p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Do your existing contacts have to pay?</h2>
    <p>No. This only applies to people who are <strong>not</strong> in your contact list. Friends, family and everyone else already in your contacts keep messaging you for free as always, and you can also add any specific person or group's members to a separate free-to-message list.</p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>How do you turn earned Stars into money?</h2>
    <p>Stars earned through Star Messages sit in the same system as Stars from a channel subscription, a paid post, or selling a gift: they convert to TON through Fragment, then to fiat. Withdrawals typically open <strong>21 days after</strong> the Stars land in your balance. Full steps: <a href="/en/blog/cash-out-telegram-stars">how to cash out Telegram Stars in Uzbekistan</a>.</p>
  </section>

